    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d264">

                <pb facs="0844" n="813" xml:id="pg813"/>

                <head>264. Telegram From the Embassy in the German Democratic Republic to the
                    Department of State.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d264-f1"/></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#float-left">278.</seg><dateline rendition="#float-right"
                            ><placeName>East Berlin</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1984-01-27">January 27, 1984, 1240Z</date></dateline></opener>
                <!--<pb facs="d264-2" n="2" type="facsimile" xml:id="d264-2"/>-->
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Asylum Seekers in Berlin.</item>
                </list>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Confidential—Entire text.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>The FRG PolCouns told us that as of this morning January 27, there were
                        asylum seekers present in the UK and French Embassies and the FRG Permanent
                        Mission in Berlin. He would not add more except that the FRG Mission faced a
                        difficult situation which may involve three separate cases, all of whom
                        entered the FRG Mission this morning.</item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Ridgway</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
